# The public site needs no environment variables.
#
# It is a static site: a consultation request is handed to WhatsApp or email
# from the browser, so there is no API URL, no secret and no database to
# configure. Copy this file to .env.local only if you later add something that
# genuinely needs a build-time value.

# There is deliberately no NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL here. The booking API that used
# to consume it is preserved under backend/ but disabled, and the staff
# dashboard that would call it is archived at frontend/_inactive/legacy-staff/.
